{"1432340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loveland", "steam_appid": 1432340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective, we have a situation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reports of kidnappings and cult activity are pouring in from a remote trailer park on the outskirts of Loveland, Ohio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All leads point to Pastor Abram, a fallen minister whose once ordinary sermons have twisted into something deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He now preaches that frogs are divine saviors… and that only the chosen will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We have reason to believe something far more dangerous is at play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.poster.avif?t=1777585481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.webm?t=1777585481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.mp4?t=1777585481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an Agency Detective tasked with investigating a rural community consumed by paranoia, faith, and something… unnatural. Uncover hidden truths, and decide how far you’re willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Every action has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How this story ends is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/3b1d85e7967eaac8babef6dfbd8f5fda.webp?t=1777585481\" width=106 height=21 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fate of a cult consumed by faith... and something far worse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Linear Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach the case your way. Follow leads, bypass obstacles, or leave secrets buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the outcome. Nothing is without consequence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet trailer park. A humid summer night. Something watching.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective, we have a situation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reports of kidnappings and cult activity are pouring in from a remote trailer park on the outskirts of Loveland, Ohio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All leads point to Pastor Abram, a fallen minister whose once ordinary sermons have twisted into something deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He now preaches that frogs are divine saviors… and that only the chosen will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We have reason to believe something far more dangerous is at play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.poster.avif?t=1777585481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.webm?t=1777585481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432340/extras/e232b8d28cb960a94128a703f064c40f.